## Optional AI components

Every component in sections 1 through 4 is required **only** for the optional
AI features (inpainting and seal OCR). The core pipeline — orientation,
deskew, denoise, stain removal, black/white level, tone, A4 output — is pure
C# with no native dependencies and runs without anything in `ai/`.

Restoria detects whether the AI runtime can load (by probing it in a child
process) and disables the AI features cleanly if not. No AI code path runs
inside the main process, so a missing or incompatible runtime cannot crash or
degrade the core tool.

## Security note

`ai/win7/onnxruntime.dll` is the stock Microsoft binary with its import table
rewritten from `api-ms-win-*` to `w7shim-*` so it resolves on Windows 7. No
instruction bytes were modified; only the DLL import descriptors. The stock
binary in `ai/onnxruntime.dll` is unmodified.